  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>On the shores of Lac de Sainte-Croix, at Bauduen, PLAYA Location rents electric boats to explore the lake's turquoise waters and go up to the Verdon gorges, with swimming stops along the way.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The official website says "pets accepted on a leash". Families have gone out on an electric boat with their dog towards the Verdon gorges, with swimming stops during the trip. Official hours: April, May and October from 10am to 6pm (closed Tuesday and Wednesday), June and September from 9am to 6pm, July and August from 9am to 7pm, weather permitting. Booking online (at least 24 hours ahead), by phone or on site. Cancellation: no refund within 72 hours of the start; the official FAQ is unclear on the exact deadlines, so have them confirmed when you book. Refreshment bar and shaded terrace on site, free car parks nearby.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming to book your slot and confirm your dog can join you on board.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Verdon gorges and Lac de Sainte-Croix provide a spectacular setting for the whole outing.</p>
